<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Mulrennan appointed business editor of Independent.</title>
<headline>Mulrennan appointed business editor of Independent.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent Newspapers Plc said on Thursday that Frank Mulrennan had been appointed business editor and associate editor at the Irish Independent newspaper.</p>
<p>Mulrennan was previously agriculture editor at the newspaper. He replaces Matt Cooper, who left the Independent to become editor of the Sunday Tribune.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
